WEBVTT

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:06.320
ANNOUNCER: Attention!
Return to start positions.

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:08.120
Return to start positions.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:09.280
(POWERING DOWN)

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:12.560
Here, let me help you. Sorry about that.

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:14.480
Yeah, you must be upset.

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:16.400
-CALHOUN: Markowski.
-Who?

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:20.040
Whoa! Oh, yeah, me. I'm Markowski. Ah!

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:22.160
What's the first rule of Hero's Duty?

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:24.720
No cuts, no butts, no coconuts?

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:28.880
Never interfere with
the first-person shooter.

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:31.760
Our job is to get the gamers
to the top of that building

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:34.440
so they can get a medal, and that's it!

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:36.560
So stick to the program, soldier!

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:37.640
Right. Right. Aye, aye.

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:39.360
ANNOUNCER: Quarter alert!
Quarter alert!

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:42.240
All right, pussy willows.
Back to start positions!

00:00:42.440 --> 00:00:43.520
Oh!

00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:47.640
Yeah, right.
No way I'm going through that again.

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:51.640
So that's where they
keep the medal, huh?

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.480
Hmm. "New racers daily."

00:00:58.760 --> 00:01:00.680
Sweet! I got next game.

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:01.800
Go away, kid!

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:03.480
We're going to play
all nine of today's racers!

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:04.600
Yeah!

00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:06.920
Sorry.

00:01:14.120 --> 00:01:16.160
(VIDEO GAME MUSIC PLAYING)

00:01:20.960 --> 00:01:22.640
Hmm. Where's the wrecking guy?

00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:26.560
Where's Ralph? He should be
wrecking the building.

00:01:26.680 --> 00:01:28.800
Shh! Stick with the program.

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:31.000
NICELANDERS: Fix it, Felix!

00:01:32.240 --> 00:01:33.520
(FELIX SPEAKING)

00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:36.640
(NERVOUS CHUCKLE)

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:38.960
(CLEARS THROAT)

00:01:39.280 --> 00:01:42.400
(WHISPERS) Ralph!
Quarter alert! Game on!

00:01:50.120 --> 00:01:51.480
(WHISPERING) Do something, Felix!

00:01:51.760 --> 00:01:54.160
Just act natural. I'll fix it.

00:01:55.480 --> 00:01:56.520
(GASPS)

00:01:58.520 --> 00:02:00.040
FELIX: Ralph! Ralph!

00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:01.320
What the...

00:02:01.840 --> 00:02:03.600
Ralph? Ralph!

00:02:05.880 --> 00:02:08.760
Oh, my land! Where is he?

00:02:09.680 --> 00:02:11.160
Mr. Litwak!

00:02:11.320 --> 00:02:12.760
What's the trouble, sweetheart?

00:02:12.840 --> 00:02:14.200
The game's busted.

00:02:14.960 --> 00:02:17.880
I can fix it! I can fix it!

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:19.000
MR. LITWAK: Oh, boy.

00:02:19.120 --> 00:02:22.120
Looks like the game's
gone cuckoo, like my nana.

00:02:22.680 --> 00:02:24.920
Sorry, sweetie.
Here's your quarter back.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:26.360
But what about the game?

00:02:26.560 --> 00:02:28.360
I'll have someone look at it tomorrow...

00:02:28.480 --> 00:02:30.600
But if he can't fix it, it might be time

00:02:30.680 --> 00:02:32.840
to put old Ralph and Felix
out to pasture.

00:02:33.160 --> 00:02:34.200
Like my nana.

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:38.120
(ALL GASP)

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:48.320
Ladies and gentlemen,
we're out of order.

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:51.200
Sweet mercy!
Without Ralph, we're doomed!

00:02:51.320 --> 00:02:53.200
They're going to pull our plug!

00:02:53.320 --> 00:02:54.480
(SCREAMING)

00:02:54.560 --> 00:02:58.160
Okay, everybody, calm down.

00:02:58.680 --> 00:03:00.200
Ralph probably fell asleep

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:01.880
in the washroom of Tapper's again.

00:03:02.640 --> 00:03:04.440
-(BELL RINGING)
-See? There he is now.

00:03:09.920 --> 00:03:13.040
Why, it's Q*bert.
What brings you here, neighbor?

00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:14.400
(MUTTERING)

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:16.360
What's he saying, Felix?

00:03:16.560 --> 00:03:19.240
Stand by. My Q*bert-ese is a little rusty.

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:20.400
(CLEARS THROAT)

00:03:20.680 --> 00:03:22.120
(MUTTERING)

00:03:29.920 --> 00:03:30.960
(GASPS)

00:03:34.600 --> 00:03:36.120
Ralph's gone Turbo!

00:03:36.240 --> 00:03:37.240
(ALL GASP)

00:03:40.440 --> 00:03:41.480
(GRUNTING)

00:03:49.440 --> 00:03:50.480
Ooh!

00:03:51.640 --> 00:03:52.760
Shiny.

00:03:53.720 --> 00:03:56.520
ANNOUNCER: Attention!
The arcade is now closed.

00:03:56.600 --> 00:03:58.040
Did you get a load of Markowski?

00:03:58.120 --> 00:04:00.120
-(LAUGHS)
-Shut your chew holes.

00:04:01.080 --> 00:04:02.040
Cy-Bug.

00:04:02.120 --> 00:04:03.280
(BOUNCING SOUND)

00:04:11.960 --> 00:04:13.400
Taste it!

00:04:18.280 --> 00:04:19.280
(GRUNTS)

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:22.480
Slick Tiddlywinking, pint-size.

00:04:22.600 --> 00:04:24.120
I'm Fix-It Felix, Jr., ma'am.

00:04:24.240 --> 00:04:26.800
From the game Fix-It Felix, Jr.

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:28.120
(GASPS)

00:04:28.280 --> 00:04:30.160
Jiminey jaminey!

00:04:30.680 --> 00:04:34.840
Look at that high definition. Your face!

00:04:35.160 --> 00:04:37.360
It's amazing!

00:04:37.640 --> 00:04:40.960
Flattery don't charge
these batteries, civilian.

00:04:41.040 --> 00:04:42.400
Now, state your business.

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:45.400
I'm looking for my colleague,
Wreck-it Ralph?

00:04:45.680 --> 00:04:47.160
Never heard of him.

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:49.520
Well, Q*bert saw him come in here.

00:04:49.960 --> 00:04:53.160
Impossible. Nothing gets past me.

00:04:53.240 --> 00:04:54.400
(METAL CLANKING)

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:56.320
That came from the tower.

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:14.480
(GRUNTING)

00:05:15.240 --> 00:05:17.400
Nice eggs. Nice eggs!

00:05:18.680 --> 00:05:20.200
Okay. That was easy.

00:05:25.520 --> 00:05:27.080
Congratulations, soldier.

00:05:27.240 --> 00:05:29.360
It is my honor to bestow upon you

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:31.520
the Medal of Heroes.

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:34.320
Wow!

00:05:48.640 --> 00:05:49.760
No way!

00:05:49.920 --> 00:05:50.920
Ten-hut!

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:53.680
(LAUGHS) Wow!

00:05:56.240 --> 00:05:59.040
History will long revere
your courage and sacrifice.

00:05:59.240 --> 00:06:00.200
Well, thank you!

00:06:00.280 --> 00:06:02.120
You have etched in the rock of virtue

00:06:02.240 --> 00:06:04.080
a legacy beyond compare.

00:06:04.400 --> 00:06:06.680
Thanks, guys. At ease!

00:06:07.080 --> 00:06:09.760
You are the universe's greatest hero.

00:06:09.880 --> 00:06:10.920
-(CRUNCHES)
-Oops!

00:06:11.560 --> 00:06:12.960
(EXCLAIMING)

00:06:13.760 --> 00:06:16.280
The living embodiment of
all this corps represents.

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:17.800
Oh. (SCREAMS)

00:06:18.240 --> 00:06:21.920
Bravery. Integrity.
Grace under pressure.

00:06:22.760 --> 00:06:24.720
-And above all, dignity.
-(GRUNTING)

00:06:24.800 --> 00:06:26.880
FEMALE ANNOUNCER:
Escape pod activated.

00:06:27.560 --> 00:06:28.800
(MUFFLED GRUNTING)

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:31.440
Get off my face!

00:06:37.440 --> 00:06:38.640
KOHUT: Incoming!

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:41.480
(RALPH SCREAMING)

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:45.640
-Ralph!
-Cy-Bug!

00:06:46.160 --> 00:06:47.240
(GRUNTING)

